{"slug":"s-w-a","ar":"س و ء","total":167,"core":"evil; harm; shame","forms":[{"ar":"سُوٓء","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":50,"gloss":"evil, harm","word":null,"ex":{"s":26,"a":156,"p":3,"ar":["وَلَا","تَمَسُّوهَا","بِسُوٓءٍ","فَيَأْخُذَكُمْ","عَذَابُ","يَوْمٍ","عَظِيمٍ"],"en":"And do not touch her with harm, lest you be seized by the punishment of a terrible day"}},{"ar":"سَيِّـَٔات","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":36,"gloss":"Bad deeds","word":"as-sayyiat","ex":{"s":16,"a":34,"p":2,"ar":["فَأَصَابَهُمْ","سَيِّـَٔاتُ","مَا","عَمِلُوا۟","وَحَاقَ","بِهِم","مَّا","كَانُوا۟","بِهِۦ","يَسْتَهْزِءُونَ"],"en":"So they were struck by the evil consequences of what they did and were enveloped by what they used to ridicule"}},{"ar":"سَآءَ","kind":"verb","form":1,"count":30,"gloss":"to be evil; to grieve","word":null,"ex":{"s":25,"a":66,"p":2,"ar":["إِنَّهَا","سَآءَتْ","مُسْتَقَرًّا","وَمُقَامًا"],"en":"Indeed, it is evil as a settlement and residence"}},{"ar":"سَيِّئَة","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":22,"gloss":"evil deed; misfortune","word":null,"ex":{"s":23,"a":96,"p":5,"ar":["ٱدْفَعْ","بِٱلَّتِى","هِىَ","أَحْسَنُ","ٱلسَّيِّئَةَ ۚ","نَحْنُ","أَعْلَمُ","بِمَا","يَصِفُونَ"],"en":"Repel, by [means of] what is best, [their] evil. We are most knowing of what they describe"}},{"ar":"سَوْء","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":9,"gloss":"evil","word":null,"ex":{"s":19,"a":28,"p":7,"ar":["يَـٰٓأُخْتَ","هَـٰرُونَ","مَا","كَانَ","أَبُوكِ","ٱمْرَأَ","سَوْءٍ","وَمَا","كَانَتْ","أُمُّكِ","بَغِيًّا"],"en":"O sister of Aaron, your father was not a man of evil, nor was your mother unchaste"}},{"ar":"أَسَآءَ","kind":"verb","form":4,"count":5,"gloss":"to do evil","word":null,"ex":{"s":41,"a":46,"p":6,"ar":["مَّنْ","عَمِلَ","صَـٰلِحًا","فَلِنَفْسِهِۦ ۖ","وَمَنْ","أَسَآءَ","فَعَلَيْهَا ۗ","وَمَا","رَبُّكَ","بِظَلَّـٰمٍ","لِّلْعَبِيدِ"],"en":"Whoever does righteousness - it is for his [own] soul; and whoever does evil [does so] against it. And your Lord is not ever unjust to [His] servants"}},{"ar":"سَوْءَٰت","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":5,"gloss":"private parts, shame","word":null,"ex":{"s":20,"a":121,"p":5,"ar":["فَأَكَلَا","مِنْهَا","فَبَدَتْ","لَهُمَا","سَوْءَٰتُهُمَا","وَطَفِقَا","يَخْصِفَانِ","عَلَيْهِمَا","مِن","وَرَقِ","ٱلْجَنَّةِ ۚ","وَعَصَىٰٓ","ءَادَمُ","رَبَّهُۥ","فَغَوَىٰ"],"en":"And Adam and his wife ate of it, and their private parts became apparent to them, and they began to fasten over themselves from the leaves of Paradise. And Adam disobeyed his Lord and erred"}},{"ar":"سَيِّئ","kind":"adjective","form":null,"count":4,"gloss":"evil","word":null,"ex":{"s":17,"a":38,"p":4,"ar":["كُلُّ","ذَٰلِكَ","كَانَ","سَيِّئُهُۥ","عِندَ","رَبِّكَ","مَكْرُوهًا"],"en":"All that - its evil is ever, in the sight of your Lord, detested"}},{"ar":"أَسْوَأ","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":2,"gloss":"worst","word":null,"ex":{"s":41,"a":27,"p":7,"ar":["فَلَنُذِيقَنَّ","ٱلَّذِينَ","كَفَرُوا۟","عَذَابًا","شَدِيدًا","وَلَنَجْزِيَنَّهُمْ","أَسْوَأَ","ٱلَّذِى","كَانُوا۟","يَعْمَلُونَ"],"en":"But We will surely cause those who disbelieve to taste a severe punishment, and We will surely recompense them for the worst of what they had been doing"}},{"ar":"سَوْءَة","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":2,"gloss":"corpse; nakedness","word":null,"ex":{"s":5,"a":31,"p":10,"ar":["فَبَعَثَ","ٱللَّهُ","غُرَابًا","يَبْحَثُ","فِى","ٱلْأَرْضِ","لِيُرِيَهُۥ","كَيْفَ","يُوَٰرِى","سَوْءَةَ","أَخِيهِ ۚ","قَالَ","يَـٰوَيْلَتَىٰٓ","أَعَجَزْتُ","أَنْ","أَكُونَ","مِثْلَ","هَـٰذَا","ٱلْغُرَابِ","فَأُوَٰرِىَ","سَوْءَةَ","أَخِى ۖ","فَأَصْبَحَ","مِنَ","ٱلنَّـٰدِمِينَ"],"en":"Then Allah sent a crow searching in the ground to show him how to hide the disgrace of his brother. He said, \"O woe to me! Have I failed to be like this crow and hide the body of my brother?\" And he became of the regretful"}},{"ar":"مُسِىٓء","kind":"active participle","form":4,"count":1,"gloss":"evildoer","word":null,"ex":{"s":40,"a":58,"p":10,"ar":["وَمَا","يَسْتَوِى","ٱلْأَعْمَىٰ","وَٱلْبَصِيرُ","وَٱلَّذِينَ","ءَامَنُوا۟","وَعَمِلُوا۟","ٱلصَّـٰلِحَـٰتِ","وَلَا","ٱلْمُسِىٓءُ ۚ","قَلِيلًا","مَّا","تَتَذَكَّرُونَ"],"en":"And not equal are the blind and the seeing, nor are those who believe and do righteous deeds and the evildoer. Little do you remember"}},{"ar":"سُّوٓأَىٰٓ","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":1,"gloss":"evil, worst","word":null,"ex":{"s":30,"a":10,"p":6,"ar":["ثُمَّ","كَانَ","عَـٰقِبَةَ","ٱلَّذِينَ","أَسَـٰٓـُٔوا۟","ٱلسُّوٓأَىٰٓ","أَن","كَذَّبُوا۟","بِـَٔايَـٰتِ","ٱللَّهِ","وَكَانُوا۟","بِهَا","يَسْتَهْزِءُونَ"],"en":"Then the end of those who did evil was the worst [consequence] because they denied the signs of Allah and used to ridicule them"}}],"surahs":[[4,14],[7,14],[16,10],[40,8],[27,7],[39,7],[3,6],[5,6],[11,6],[13,6],[6,5],[9,5],[48,5],[2,4],[12,4],[17,4],[28,4],[29,4],[35,4],[42,4],[45,4],[20,3],[25,3],[30,3],[41,3],[10,2],[21,2],[26,2],[47,2],[8,1],[14,1],[18,1],[19,1],[23,1],[33,1],[37,1],[46,1],[53,1],[58,1],[60,1],[63,1],[64,1],[65,1],[66,1],[67,1]]}